QTLSim validate/symbolic/check_fst.jl (Symbolics 7.48.0)

(a) the island model: the reduced coalescence recursion
  fixed point: S₀ = 1 + 2N(1 − π₀ + π₁)/π₁, S₁ = S₀ + (π₀ − π₁)/π₁, W = 1 + S₀ ok
  so V_W = V_m(S₀ − 1) = 2NV_m(1 − π₀ + π₁)/π₁ and σ²_B = 2V_m(π₀ − π₁)/π₁ ok
  island: π₀ − π₁ = (1 − mk/(k − 1))² = λ                                  ok
  island: π₁ = (1 − λ)/k                                                   ok
  V_W = 2NkV_m, whatever m                                                 ok
  σ²_B = 2kV_m λ/(1 − λ)                                                   ok
  σ²_B/(2V_W) = λ/(2N(1 − λ)), so Q_ST (:demes) = λ/(λ + 2N(1 − λ))        ok
  Q_ST (:total) = (k−1)/k·R/((k−1)/k·R + 1) = (k−1)λ/((k−1)λ + 2Nk(1 − λ)) ok
  k = ∞: λ/(λ + 2N(1 − λ)) = (1 − m)²/(2N − (2N − 1)(1 − m)²) (Wright)     ok
  small m: 1 − λ = 2mk/(k−1) + O(m²), so 1/Q_ST − 1 = 4Nmk/(k−1) + O(m²) (:demes, Takahata) ok
  … and ×k/(k − 1): 4Nm(k/(k − 1))² + O(m²) (:total)                       ok
  panmixia m = (k − 1)/k: λ = 0, Q_ST = 0                                  ok

(b) the kernel's exchanges
  island: π₁ = u(2 − ku), u = m/(k − 1)                                    ok
  exchanges: V_W → 2NV_m(kN − 1)/(N − 1) as m → 0                          ok
  … only to leading order: ∂V_W/∂u = 2NV_m·2k(k − 1)/(N(2 − 2/N)²) at m = 0 (relative O(m/N)) ok
  two distinct adults of the metapopulation share a deme w.p. kN(N−1)/(kN(kN−1)) = (N−1)/(kN−1) ok

(c) Slatkin's stepping stone
  F_ST = (t_i − t₀)/(t_i + t₀) = 1/(1 + 8Nmk/((k − i)i)) (Slatkin 1991, eqs 16–17) ok

